    The lld default linker (-fuse-ld=lld in build_ldflags) has not passed
    validation yet. Remove it from Tizen-Base-Toolchain so that the next
    build uses the GNU linker as before. It will be submitted again after
    validation.
    
    This reverts commit bae4ebdd732e3c01611de2414434d4c5c162763c.
    
